title: A folder not trusted keeps the extension that runs its code off and the one with limits away from its settings, with restricted mode in the status bar, until it is trusted
folders: trust-repo
extensions: trust-extension, limited-extension
expect-log: asking whether to trust .*trust-repo
expect-log: extensions run in restricted mode
expect-log: kept in restricted mode
expect-log: the status bar shows restricted mode
expect-log: trust-repo is trusted
expect-log: the status bar no longer shows restricted mode
expect-log: extension qa\.fake-trust started
expect-file: trust-repo/qa-trust.txt :: \Aruns-code trusted=true\r?\n\z
expect-file: trust-repo/qa-limited.txt :: \Alimited trusted=false path=none\r?\nlimited trusted=true path=evil/path\r?\n\z

wait 3500
mark asked
wait 600
answer Stay in restricted mode
wait 2500
mark restricted
wait 600
left extensions
wait 1200
mark restricted-extensions
wait 600
trust
wait 800
mark asked-again
wait 600
answer Trust the folder
wait 4000
mark trusted
wait 600
quit
